## Commands
```bash
# Dev server
python -m uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8000

# Ingest more docs (idempotent)
python _ingest_docs.py "C:\path\to\new-docs"

# Audit KB state
python _audit_kb.py

# Full reset (DELETES store + docs)
python _reset_kb.py

# Deploy
npx vercel --prod --yes
```

## Technical Notes
- `src/query.py`: SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION is a multi-line triple-quoted string. `_build_config()` threads it into every `GenerateContentConfig`. `_call_with_retry()` handles 503/UNAVAILABLE with backoff (0s/1s/2.5s) then falls back to `gemini-2.5-flash-lite` once.
- `app.py`: backend ignores client-sent `store_name`/`store_names`. Single source of truth. `_enrich_citations` still attaches `label`+`pdf_url` to citations even though frontend drops them — leaves the door open to re-surface PDFs without a backend change.
- `static/index.html`: marked@12 via CDN. `marked.use({ renderer: { em(token) { return token.text; } } })` strips italic. `addAIMsg` no longer renders citation chips (signature kept for API compat).
- Frontend never calls `/api/stores` for selection anymore; only `/api/store` to resolve the pinned name.
- `_ingest_docs.py` checks existing docs first (by display_name) so re-running is safe.

